{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1495660-help-requested-beasts-shaping-the-astral-like-demons-subverting-infrastructures","id":1495660,"title":"[Help Requested] Beasts Shaping The Astral Like Demons Subverting Infrastructures","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-27T11:47:26-07:00","id":1495660,"title":"[Help Requested] Beasts Shaping The Astral Like Demons Subverting Infrastructures","content":"Basically, how can I write a variation of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1452106-homebrew-expanded-infrastructure-hijacking\"><b>this system</b></a> which lets Beasts do something similar for their own parts of the setting? <br /> <br /> I think this version would be called something like &quot;Nightmarish Cultivation&quot;, and would likewise require Uncovering Clues with the auxiliary use of the Beast power-set (e.g. scanning for new Chambers, delving into other dimensions via Skeleton Key).<br /> <br /> But what would be equivalent categories of Clues? Should they be associated with the 5 main Hungers instead of types of Infrastructures? Or maybe there is no such sub-division for Clue Elements, and instead these Cultivation Conditions have a more indirect and subtle influence over baseline reality?<br /> <br /> What could be some broad and versatile suggestions for Cultivation Conditions, and what Merits could you acquire via their Beats? I vaguely remember that one of the Beast supplements explains the ecosystem of the Primordial Dream in more detail. If so, can y'all please point me to the name and page so I can check it out?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T11:55:22-07:00","id":1495662,"title":"","content":"To what particular end?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T12:07:35-07:00","id":1495664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1495660-help-requested-beasts-shaping-the-astral-like-demons-subverting-infrastructures?p=1495662#post1495662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To what particular end?</div> </div> </div> </div>I just think it is an interesting idea to give some moderately mechanical guidelines for how the Family, Hunger, Legend, Kinship and their intersection can have long-lasting effects on the collective imagination of the local population. Maybe there is a Makara Collector out there whose actions reshape the Primordial Dream in such a way that a mortal gets recurring nightmares about a Kraken of sorts.<br /> <br /> But what if that mortal happens to be the owner of a toy company, and he decides to sublimate and placate that fear by creating a new line of Kraken-like toys, and then children who sleep next to these toys become further vectors for nightmares related to that Makara Collector? Soon enough, you have certain narrative consequences worthy of Beats on your hands, such as groups of worried parents posting on online forums about the suspicious ideas their children get from these toys... which in turn attracts questions from an undercover Hacker-Hero.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T12:20:46-07:00","id":1495667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1495660-help-requested-beasts-shaping-the-astral-like-demons-subverting-infrastructures?p=1495664#post1495664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just think it is an interesting idea to give some moderately mechanical guidelines for how the Family, Hunger, Legend, Kinship and their intersection can have long-lasting effects on the collective imagination of the local population. Maybe there is a Makara Collector out there whose actions reshape the Primordial Dream in such a way that a mortal gets recurring nightmares about a Kraken of sorts.<br /> <br /> But what if that mortal happens to be the owner of a toy company, and he decides to sublimate and placate that fear by creating a new line of Kraken-like toys, and then children who sleep next to these toys become further vectors for nightmares related to that Makara Collector? Soon enough, you have certain narrative consequences worthy of Beats on your hands, such as groups of worried parents posting on online forums about the suspicious ideas their children get from these toys... which in turn attracts questions from an undercover Hacker-Hero.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay....so why not build from the Astral manipulation rules in the BPG? Why root it in the Infrastructure hack you made?<br /> <br /> As always, it's important to know what your goals and motivation for a hack are-they often explain the shape of the function you're looking for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T12:31:32-07:00","id":1495668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1495660-help-requested-beasts-shaping-the-astral-like-demons-subverting-infrastructures?p=1495667#post1495667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay....so why not build from the Astral manipulation rules in the BPG? Why root it in the Infrastructure hack you made?<br /> <br /> As always, it's important to know what your goals and motivation for a hack are-they often explain the shape of the function you're looking for.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't necessarily have to be rooted into my Demon hack at all, it was just the first comparable system I thought of. Also, I just could not remember if Beast already had something official for this for the life of me. I suppose I should have made that more explicit. Player's Guide, huh? Thanks, will look into it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}